   "id": "casm-examples-md-3",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "```casm\n.func main\n    PUSH 3\n    STORE 0\n    LOAD 0\n    PUSH 2\n    GT\n    JZ L42\n    PUSH_STR \"big\"\n    CAP_CALL \"io.print\" 1\n    JMP L49\nL42:\n    PUSH_STR \"small\"\n    CAP_CALL \"io.print\" 1\nL49:\n    PUSH_NULL\n    RET\n```\n\n**`try` / `catch`:**\n",
