   "id": "casm-examples-md-5",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "```casm\n.func main\n    ENTER_TRY L15\n    PUSH_STR \"bad\"\n    THROW\n    EXIT_TRY\n    JMP L28\nL15:\n    STORE 0\n    PUSH_STR \"caught \"\n    LOAD 0\n    CAP_CALL \"io.print\" 2\nL28:\n    PUSH_NULL\n    RET\n```\n\n**`for x in array`** expands into an index loop: the array in slot 1, the index in\nslot 2, and `ARR_LEN … GT … JZ` as the loop test:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
